{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301224","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301224","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1430122401:0":{"text":"そうだったのか……前にも噂は小耳に挟んでたけどな。","source_cn":"原来是这样……之前也有人告诉了我一些情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF80D20E45794754E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430122402:0":{"text":"村も、これからいろいろ変わっていくかもな……でも、まだ鍛造用の窯火は完全に消えてないんだろ？","source_cn":"我知道接下来很多事情将会发生变化……但是村子里用来的锻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4CA9F77B5417EE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430122403:0":{"text":"あれこれ考えても仕方ない。俺にできるのは、この木材を無事に窯に届けることだけだ。","source_cn":"对我而言想再多也没用，我只要保证这些木头最终都能进入炉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4A1BBDE46B9BD7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工诺力":{"text":"現場監督のノリー","source":"监工诺力","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}